WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.580
Here's what we found. Your homepage tells a strong story. People can really see your mission.

2
00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.760
What the page doesn't do yet is ask.

3
00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:14.120
To apply, to give, or to shop.

4
00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:20.520
So here's where we'd start: four small fixes. Nothing gets rebuilt.

5
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:23.970
First, say what's on offer.

6
00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.780
Right now, the link just says “Click Here.”

7
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:30.160
After, it says “Apply for Free Job Training.”

8
00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:32.640
And the headline tells people what's on offer.

9
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.330
Second, let people sign up without leaving.

10
00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.340
The newsletter form sits right in your footer.

11
00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:42.210
So nobody has to leave your site.

12
00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.720
Third, the Shop button names the mission.

13
00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:49.810
Every purchase supports free job training.

14
00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:53.610
And fourth, a simpler menu.

15
00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:57.620
Five clear choices. Nothing's removed.

16
00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:00.040
Give and Donate stay right where they are.

17
00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:08.090
Then there's the work around it. AI agents draft your social posts. And your team decides.

18
00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.320
Approve it, and it's ready to go.

19
00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:17.330
Ask for a rewrite, and a new draft comes back.

20
00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:21.540
Fix a word yourself, then approve.

21
00:01:22.690 --> 00:01:26.710
Or say why not. The agent rewrites it, following your note.

22
00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:32.260
Say it once, and the next drafts follow it.

23
00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:35.140
And a person still approves every post.

24
00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:44.210
So, start small. One fix first, with a sandbox alongside. Your call.
